- continuous-eval (https://github.com/relari-ai/continuous-eval)
  Copyright Relari, Inc. (Yi Zhang, Pasquale Antonante and contributors).
  Apache License 2.0.
  rag-eval-gate computes every metric through continuous-eval's public
  Metric classes (PrecisionRecallF1, RankedRetrievalMetrics,
  DeterministicFaithfulness, DeterministicAnswerCorrectness).
  Pinned at 0.3.14.post2. Its anonymous telemetry is disabled by setting
  CONTINUOUS_EVAL_DO_NOT_TRACK=true before it is imported.

